<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA 55-8 AT TEA V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 55-8 AT TEA V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, chasing an improbable 395 to win, were 55 for eight at tea on the third day of the first test against South Africa at Kingsmead on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 235 and 259 (B.McMillan 51 not out; V.Prasad 5-93); India 100 and 55-8.</p>
